  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OWSD Fellowship and GenderInSITE 2012-2016 - GenderInSITE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OWSD Fellowship and GenderInSITE 2012-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OSWD har genom sitt Forskarutbildningsprogram erbjudit stipendier    f&#xf6;r forskarutbildning inom basvetenskaperna till unga kvinnor sedan   1998. Programmet &#xe4;r &#xf6;ppet f&#xf6;r kvinnor under 40 &#xe5;r, fr&#xe5;n l&#xe4;nder i      Afrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara och l&#xe5;ginkomstl&#xe4;nder. Kvalifikationskrav &#xe4;r en masterexamen eller en kandidatexamen med extraordin&#xe4;rt goda betyg ino</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The OWSD has through its Postgraduate Training Fellowships offered    scholarship for research training in the natural sciences to young    women since 1998. The programme is open for women under forty years   of age from Sub-Saharan Africa and other low-income countries. The    entry requirement is either an MSc degree or an outstanding BSc       honours degree in a natural scientific field.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase women&apos;s participation, particularly young female scientists, leadership and influence in science and technology in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
